{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_phase_4", "label": "Phase 4 \u2014 Effects and synchronization", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_synchronize_external", "label": "Effects synchronize with external systems", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not a lifecycle callback. An effect is caused by rendering, and setup/cleanup are a pair React may run any number of times."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_useeffect", "label": "useEffect", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_dependency_array", "label": "The dependency array is not a preference", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lying produces an effect that reads one render's values forever. To remove a dep you must prove the linter it is not read."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_cleanup_contract", "label": "Cleanup contract", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "setup \u2192 cleanup \u2192 setup must be indistinguishable from setup alone. Cleanup runs with old values, tied to deps not lifetime."}, {